<title>USA: Coastal conducting internal probe of workers.</title>
<headline>Coastal conducting internal probe of workers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Corp said it initiated an internal investigation into possible employee violations of corporate policy.</p>
<p>&quot;We are conducting an internal investigation of certain employees regarding the possible violation of company policy,&quot; said Steve Eames, spokesman for the Houston, Texas-based oil and natural gas pipeline company.</p>
<p>Eames said neither the possible violations nor the probe would be financially material to the company.  He also declined comment on the nature of the possible violations.</p>
<p>Eames would not comment on how many employees are the target of the internal probe or what part of the company they work for.</p>
<p>((-- New York Energy Desk, 212-859-1620))</p>
